  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.80",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.80\n\nReleased on 2026-11-22.\n\nDropping a clip onto main-track clips can now insert it there. Studio previews match the export more closely, and a drive that stops answering no longer stalls a project.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Studio:** Dropping a clip onto main-track clips can insert it there ([08bd7fc12](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/08bd7fc126b1ae158bc9503672acbd88099c9cab), [#8397](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8397)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Engine:** An asset download fails once when the egress proxy drops its tunnel ([da1476e48](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/da1476e48d701d89187f8236ca9f4fc6b9e12158), [#8417](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8417)).\n- **Studio:** An insert on drop never lets linked partners overlap or start before 0 ([8929d1164](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8929d116499e10f06622c701ef54d31637c3aef5), [#8416](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8416)).\n- **Studio:** A refused delete no longer brings back another delete still saving ([c1f4a193a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c1f4a193a9e3e72776a1433ba72298f5d38237d4), [#8413](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8413)).\n- **Engine:** A capture proxy request whose name will not resolve is reported as failed ([75c83d877](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/75c83d87723595b07a058c504efefca1c6be0170), [#8409](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8409)).\n- **Studio:** A sealed undo of a GSAP-animated layer's style shows in place ([c3a673990](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c3a67399039ce87adaf2e78d4f7acf6e9a46f20a), [#8320](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8320)).\n- **Media Use:** A project manifest's provider claim never writes a sound credit ([ec1839e4a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/ec1839e4a17925d9c04dce5bfd5153b4f3ca8a27), [#8410](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8410)).\n- **Studio Server:** A file the drive never answers no longer holds a project's first history copy ([267ffc46c](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/267ffc46c990e18246f964e8f96bd50a10784707), [#8187](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8187)).\n- **Studio:** Fx badges in a sealed preview show the clip's look, crop and duck ([8a69ea039](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8a69ea039594d2eb353b7be40ba5b430c854faec), [#8411](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8411)).\n- **Studio:** A paused untagged video shows the colours the export renders ([71907274a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/71907274a7aa0710717db15bec4ec1ab7b7fe8ee), [#8405](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8405)).\n- **CLI:** Show copy file names in check progress lines as visible text ([4a5a5eb27](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/4a5a5eb27e643a2b9daf3cceab95607c32558324), [#8407](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8407)).\n- **Studio:** A delete and its ripple shift save as one edit ([7ec38388b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/7ec38388bf9066bdf33d87ac4cd15c63c96068d5), [#8404](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8404)).\n- **Studio:** The poster rendered for the next open no longer delays a clip's picture ([da46c89e2](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/da46c89e2a0b8d3427cf291b0ee1531d695e74c8), [#8400](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8400)).\n- **Studio Server:** A file the drive never answers no longer holds a project's first copy ([71dc6f2fe](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/71dc6f2fe1fdbd797ea72c35a420f649ba88a905), [#8403](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8403)).\n- **CLI:** The compile cache lives only in the private HyperFrames cache folder ([8127bb885](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8127bb8856d51df14764224c234427d66bbe0642), [#8401](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8401)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- **Engine:** The frame-tag checks get the time a real encode needs ([2b4706f19](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/2b4706f193c6d42a9bfa630d8f0e009aaa3c4b1d), [#8415](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8415)).\n- **Studio Server:** The Windows workflow fails when the link tests cannot run ([b008e37b4](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b008e37b46148b4baebe6e11d72a6b9801a289ea), [#8395](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/8395)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.79...v0.9.80\n"
}
